### Create Workflow while Kafka is down
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "VENDOR_ONBOARDING",
  "requesterId": "usr_ashish_01",
  "title": "Kafka Failure Resiliency Test 2"
}

### Verify CQRS Projection in Analytics Service
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/analytics/workflows/6617deac-76dc-4599-ab42-3bf60d6273ef

### Replay all quarantined events after recovering Kafka
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/outbox/replay-failed

### Or replay a single event by ID
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/outbox/events/6617deac-76dc-4599-ab42-3bf60d6273ef/replay


### 1. Create Workflow (Identity extracted from X-User-Id header)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: usr_ashish_01
X-User-Roles: ROLE_EMPLOYEE

{
  "templateId": "VENDOR_ONBOARDING",
  "title": "Onboard Acme Cloud Services"
}

### 2. Submit KYC Documents as Requester (Succeeds -> moves to PENDING_LEGAL_VERIFY)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows/fc6ad61b-41e6-439d-8068-f020c9972c4c/transition
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: usr_ashish_01
X-User-Roles: ROLE_EMPLOYEE

{
  "action": "SUBMIT_DOCS",
  "comments": "Uploaded PAN and GST",
  "payload": {
    "panCardUrl": "https://storage.internal/kyc/pan.pdf",
    "gstCertUrl": "https://storage.internal/kyc/gst.pdf"
  }
}

### 3. Negative Test: Finance Manager tries to approve Legal step (Fails: Missing ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows/fc6ad61b-41e6-439d-8068-f020c9972c4c/transition
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: usr_rahul_finance
X-User-Roles: ROLE_FINANCE_MANAGER

{
  "action": "VERIFY_AND_ONBOARD",
  "comments": "Trying to approve without Legal role"
}

### 4. Positive Test: Legal Counsel approves with ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL (Succeeds -> ONBOARDED)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows/fc6ad61b-41e6-439d-8068-f020c9972c4c/transition
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: legal_counsel_meera
X-User-Roles: ROLE_LEGAL_COUNSEL,ROLE_EMPLOYEE

{
  "action": "VERIFY_AND_ONBOARD",
  "comments": "Verified KYC compliance. Approved."
}